      <body>
         <div type="edition">
            <ab xml:lang="Grek grc">
               <pb n="convex" /><lb n="1" rend="left-to-right" /><persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p21875">Πραξοῦς <note>or Πραγίους?</note>
                  <surname>Πετεχῶντος</surname></persName>
               <rs ref="ancient_titles.xml#id369" type="title">ὀνηλάτης</rs>
               <lb n="2" rend="left-to-right" />ὁδοῦ <placeName ref="places.xml#15">Φιλῶν</placeName>
               <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p21880">Σεραπάμμων</persName>
               <note> l. Σεραπάμμωνι</note> χαίρειν. <lb n="3" rend="left-to-right" />ἔσχον παρὰ σοῦ ἀπὸ τῆς συντελίας <note> l. συντελείας</note><lb n="4" rend="left-to-right" />τῶν ἑκατὸν δραχμῶν δραχ- <lb break="no" n="5" rend="left-to-right" />μὰς τεσσαράκοντα ὀκτώ, καὶ ἔστιν <lb n="6" rend="left-to-right" />ἐμὸν ἰδιόγραφον. <lb n="7" rend="left-to-right" /><date notAfter="+193-10-03" notBefore="+193-10-03" when-custom="Septimius_Severus:2">(ἔτους) β// Φαῶφι ϛ</date>. </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:lang="Latn en">
               <pb n="convex" /><lb n="1" rend="left-to-right" />Praxous (Pragious?), son of Petechon, donkey driver <lb n="2" rend="left-to-right" />on the way to Philae, to Serapammon greetings. <lb n="3" rend="left-to-right" />I have received from you out of our joint tax farming business <lb n="4" rend="left-to-right" />of the hundred drachmae <lb n="5" rend="left-to-right" />forty eight drachmae, and this is <lb n="6" rend="left-to-right" />written by myself.<lb n="7" rend="left-to-right" />Year 2, Phaophi 6.</ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text></TEI>